{
  "id": "苍梧",
  "name": "苍梧",
  "pinyin": "",
  "aliases": [],
  "type": "place",
  "typeConfidence": "medium",
  "description": "山名，位于西北地区，一说为昆仑山的群山之一",
  "mentions": [
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 10,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-10-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "苍梧之山，帝舜葬于阳，帝丹朱葬于阴"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-05",
      "type": "annotation",
      "annotationExplanation": "山名，位于西北地区，一说为昆仑山的群山之一"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-13-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "西胡白玉山在大夏东，苍梧在白玉山西南，皆在流沙西，昆仑"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 15,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-15-02",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "泛天之山，赤水穷焉。赤水之东有苍梧之野，舜与叔均之所葬也。爰有文"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 1,
      "entryId": "chuci-01-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n\n溘埃风余上征。\n\n朝发轫于苍梧兮，\n\n夕余至乎县圃。\n\n欲少"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "chuci-13-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "\n\n步余马兮洞庭。\n\n平明发兮苍梧,\n\n夕投宿兮石城。\n\n芙蓉盖"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 13,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-13-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "故葬埋足以收敛盖藏而已。昔舜葬苍梧，市不变其肆；禹葬会稽之山，农"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 22,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-22-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "岩穴，各有家室。南征三苗，道死苍梧。禹沐浴淫雨，栉扶风，决江疏河"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
    "bookId": "shanhaijing",
    "chapterIndex": 10
  }
}
